This product includes a general English frequency wordlist derived from:

  FrequencyWords — https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords
  Copyright (c) 2016 Hermit Dave, MIT License

which is itself derived from the OpenSubtitles corpus.

The list is used only to decide whether a token is ordinary English. It is included in
source form at resources/wordlist.txt and regenerated by scripts/fetch_wordlist.sh.
